  "instructions": [
    "place the copper pot over medium heat on the stovetop.",
    "add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 5-7 minutes.",
    "add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "add the chicken drumsticks, potatoes, oregano, cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper. stir to combine.",
    "add the chopped ají amarillo pepper and sliced ginger, if using.",
    "pour in the chicken broth and bring the mixture to a boil.",
    "reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 25-30 minutes, or until the chicken is cooked through and the potatoes are tender.",
    "serve hot, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro, if desired."
